**Your use of this Product constitutes your acknowledgment and acceptance of all terms herein. If you do not agree, you must discontinue use immediately.**

## 1.1

We strictly comply with statutory cybersecurity obligations and implement industry-standard safeguards to maintain stable operation of the Product and services. We shall not be liable for any losses arising from force majeure, telecommunication carrier network failures, your device malfunctions, your improper operation, or malicious third-party attacks that are unavoidable despite fulfillment of required security duties.For service interruptions, data breaches, or property losses caused by our failure to perform statutory cybersecurity duties or inherent technical defects of the Product, we shall assume corresponding compensation liability in accordance with applicable laws of the People's Republic of China (excluding the laws of Hong Kong SAR, Macao SAR, and Taiwan Region; the same applies hereinafter).

## 1.2

We warrant that the core functions of the Product are consistent with those published on the official product page. We will continuously optimize performance and fix vulnerabilities to ensure normal usability.If inherent technical defects prevent the core functions from functioning properly, you may request us to remedy the defects or refund the fees paid for the relevant paid services.

## 1.3

The services provided are deeply integrated with Artificial Intelligence (AI) technologies. The underlying AI capabilities are implemented via compliant third-party Large Language Model (LLM) APIs.Your use of the Product is conditional upon your full acknowledgment and acceptance that AI technologies involve inherent technical limitations affected by multiple factors, including technological maturity, algorithm logic, third-party LLM iterations, and third-party LLM service terms:

(a) We strongly recommend that you independently and carefully verify, evaluate, and filter AI-generated output before use, and assess its accuracy, completeness, and fitness for purpose. Content generated by the Product is for reference only and does not constitute professional advice in any field, including but not limited to legal, medical, or financial advice.To the fullest extent permitted by applicable laws of China, we make no express or implied warranties regarding the absolute accuracy, completeness, or fitness for use of output beyond the core functions stated on the product page. Any risks and legal consequences arising from decisions, operations, or actions based on such output shall be borne solely by you.

(b) You understand and agree that AI-assisted operation depends on multiple objective factors, including third-party LLM intent recognition and algorithm analysis, system compatibility, network conditions, device environment, and third-party platform rules. Such operations involve inherent risks, including but not limited to recognition errors, execution delays, and function adaptation failures.To the fullest extent permitted by applicable laws of China, we make no express or implied warranties regarding the accuracy, completeness, fitness, timeliness, or alignment with your expectations of AI-assisted results.

(c) To mitigate usage risks, we recommend that you carefully review instructions, confirm operation scope, and exercise due diligence before launching any command or operation. If you fail to exercise such due diligence, use ambiguous instructions, conduct non-compliant operations, or act on independent decisions, resulting in device anomalies, operational deviations, third-party application errors, data loss, or other issues, you shall independently assess and bear the corresponding risks and consequences.To the fullest extent permitted by applicable laws, we shall not be liable for any losses under such circumstances. Data loss or device anomalies caused by ambiguous instructions, disabled manual confirmation mode, or independent execution shall be borne by you.

(d) For issues arising from inherent technical limitations of third-party LLMs (including but not limited to output hallucinations, factual errors, incorrect technical solutions, intent recognition failures, API service outages, and function adaptation failures due to model updates), we will use commercially reasonable efforts to complete adaptation, optimization, and troubleshooting within a reasonable time to ensure a smooth user experience.Unless otherwise expressly provided in this Agreement, we shall not be liable to you for any damages or losses caused by such inherent LLM technical risks.

(e) Permission Management: You shall restrict access to sensitive folders or system functions via 玄枢AI's settings interface in accordance with the ****principle of least privilege****. If you voluntarily grant full disk read-write permissions, you are deemed to have foreseen and accepted the operational uncertainties under high-permission mode, including the risk of full disk data deletion or corruption that may occur when uninstalling the software. All related consequences shall be borne by you.

## 1.4

We use reasonable efforts to ensure compatibility between the Product and third-party platforms. If related functions become unavailable due to changes in page structure or third-party platform rules, we will complete adaptation and optimization within a reasonable time or issue a public notice if adaptation is not feasible.

## 1.5

To the fullest extent permitted by applicable laws, we shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, punitive, or exemplary damages, including but not limited to indirect losses, lost profits, reputational damage, data loss, or business interruption, whether based on contract, tort (including negligence), strict liability, or other legal theories, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages.

## 1.6

Except for the warranties expressly set forth herein, to the fullest extent permitted by applicable laws, we disclaim all other express or implied warranties, including but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement of third-party rights.The Product and services are provided to you on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis.

## 1.7

Any oral or written advice or information you obtain from us shall not constitute any warranty not expressly stated in this Agreement. Your use of the Product and services is at your sole risk.

# 2. Arbitration Clause

Please read this section carefully. It may significantly affect your legal rights, including your right to file a lawsuit in court.

## 2.1

We may contact you via email [] to address any questions or concerns regarding your use of the services or Product. Most issues can be resolved through this channel.You and we agree to use good-faith negotiations to resolve any dispute, claim, or disagreement directly before either party initiates litigation or arbitration.

## 2.2

If no resolution is reached within thirty (30) days from the commencement of informal dispute resolution under the preceding clause, either party may initiate binding arbitration.Any dispute or claim arising out of or relating to this Agreement, including its formation, validity, performance, breach, liability, or termination, shall be referred to the ****China International Economic and Trade Arbitration Commission (CIETAC)**** for arbitration in accordance with its then-effective arbitration rules. The place of arbitration shall be ****Shenzhen, China****, and the language of arbitration shall be ****Chinese****.

## 2.3

You and we further agree that any arbitration shall be conducted in your respective individual capacities only, and not as a class action, class arbitration, or other representative proceeding. You and we expressly waive any right to initiate a class action, class arbitration, or seek collective relief.

## 2.4

This Agreement and all matters arising out of or relating to it shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the People's Republic of China, without regard to its conflict of laws principles.

# 3. Contact Information

All questions, notices, requests, or communications regarding this Agreement and the Privacy Policy should be directed to the Company:

## 3.1 Technical Support

support@xuanshu.local

# 4. Term and Termination

## 4.1 Term

This Agreement takes effect on the date you first use the services and remains in effect for as long as you use the services and unless terminated by either party in accordance with the terms herein.

## 4.2 Termination by You

You may terminate this Agreement at any time by ceasing to access and use the services.

## 4.3 Termination by Us

We may unilaterally terminate this Agreement without prior notice if we reasonably believe you have breached any term hereof. We may also terminate this Agreement upon written notice to you.

# 5. Indemnification

## 5.1 Indemnity

To the fullest extent permitted by applicable laws, you agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless us from and against any and all losses, costs, liabilities, and expenses (including but not limited to court costs, arbitration fees, legal fees, awards, and settlements) arising out of or related to your use of the services or your breach of this Agreement.

# 6. General Provisions

## 6.1 Entire Agreement

Unless otherwise stated in this Agreement, this Agreement constitutes the entire and exclusive agreement between you and us regarding your use of the services. This Agreement supersedes all prior or contemporaneous oral or written agreements between you and us concerning your use of the services.

## 6.2 Force Majeure

We shall not be liable for any failure to perform obligations under this Agreement due to events beyond our reasonable control, including but not limited to acts of God, war, civil unrest, terrorism, embargoes, acts of civil or military authorities, fire, flood, or accidents.

## 6.3 Assignment

You may not assign any rights or obligations under this Agreement. Any such assignment shall be null and void.

## 6.4 No Waiver

Failure by either party to enforce any provision of this Agreement shall not constitute a waiver of the right to enforce such provision.

## 6.5 Severability

If any provision of this Agreement is found to be invalid or unenforceable, such provision shall be enforced to the maximum extent permitted by law. If such provision cannot be reformed, it shall be deemed deleted, and the remaining provisions shall remain in full force and effect.`,vne=`## 1. Statement to Users

Your use of this product is subject to your acknowledgment and acceptance of all contents of this statement. If you do not agree, you shall immediately stop using this product.

1.1

We shall strictly fulfill statutory cybersecurity protection obligations and adopt industry-standard security measures to ensure the stable operation of products and services. We shall not be liable for any losses arising from force majeure events, telecom operator network failures, your own device malfunctions, improper operations, malicious third-party attacks, technical vulnerabilities, or objective industry flaws that cannot be avoided even after fulfilling necessary security protection obligations.

1.2

We guarantee that the core functions of the product are consistent with those published on the official product page. We will continuously optimize product performance, fix product vulnerabilities, and ensure normal usability of the product. If the core functions cannot be realized due to inherent technical defects of the product itself, you have the right to request us to fix the defects or refund the fees you paid for relevant paid services.

1.3

The services provided by the product are deeply integrated with Artificial Intelligence (AI) technology, and its underlying AI capabilities are realized by invoking APIs of compliant third-party Large Language Models (LLMs). By using this product, you fully acknowledge and agree that AI technology has inherent technical limitations affected by multiple factors, including technological maturity, algorithm logic, iterations of third-party LLMs, and service rules of third-party LLMs:

(a) We always recommend that you independently and carefully verify, judge and screen AI-generated outputs before using product services, and independently evaluate the accuracy, completeness and applicability of the outputs. Content generated by the product is for reference only and does not constitute professional advice in any fields, including but not limited to legal, medical treatment and financial fields. To the maximum extent permitted by applicable Chinese laws, we make no express or implied warranties regarding the absolute accuracy, completeness or applicability of outputs beyond the core functions stated on the product page. You shall solely bear all risks and legal consequences arising from any decisions, operations or actions made based on the outputs.

(b) You understand and agree that the realization of AI-assisted operation capabilities depends on multiple objective factors, including intent recognition and algorithm analysis of third-party LLMs, system compatibility, network status, device environment and third-party platform rules. The execution results of such capabilities have inherent risks, including but not limited to recognition deviation, execution delay and function adaptation failure. To the maximum extent permitted by applicable Chinese laws, we make no express or implied warranties regarding the accuracy, completeness, applicability, timeliness or consistency with your expectations of AI-assisted results.

(c) To help you reduce usage risks better, we always recommend that you carefully check command content, confirm operation scope and perform prudent verification before initiating any instructions or executing any operations. If device abnormalities, operation deviations, third-party application response errors, data loss or other relevant issues occur due to your failure to perform prudent verification, ambiguous command wording, non-compliant operations or independent decision-based execution, you shall independently evaluate and bear corresponding risks and consequences. To the maximum extent permitted by applicable laws, we shall not be liable for any losses arising from the above situations. Any data loss or device abnormality caused by ambiguous instructions, disabled manual confirmation mode or independent decision-based execution shall be borne by users themselves.

(d) For issues caused by inherent technical limitations of third-party LLMs (including but not limited to output hallucinations, factual deviations, incorrect technical solutions, intent recognition errors, API service interruptions and function adaptation failures due to model iterations), we will use reasonable commercial efforts to complete adaptation optimization and troubleshooting within a reasonable time to provide you with a smooth user experience. Unless otherwise explicitly agreed in this Agreement, we shall not be liable to you for any infringement, compensation or breach of contract damages, nor shall we compensate for losses arising from inherent technical risks of the above LLMs.

(e) Permission Management: You shall follow the "least privilege principle" to restrict sensitive folders or system functions through the settings interface provided by GMKtec Claw. If you actively grant full read-write permissions, you shall be deemed to have foreseen and voluntarily assumed risks of operational uncertainty under high-privilege mode, including risks of full disk data deletion or corruption that may occur when uninstalling the software. All related consequences shall be borne by you.

1.4

We will try our best to ensure compatibility between the product and third-party platforms. If relevant product functions become unavailable due to changes in page structure or third-party platform rules, we will complete adaptation optimization within a reasonable time or issue an announcement if adaptation is not feasible.

1.5

To the maximum extent permitted by applicable laws, we shall not be liable to you for any indirect, incidental, punitive or exemplary damages, including but not limited to direct losses, indirect losses, profit losses, goodwill losses, data losses or losses caused by business interruptions, regardless of whether such liabilities are based on contract, tort (including negligence), strict liability or other legal theories, even if we have been informed of possible damages.

1.6

Except for the warranties explicitly specified in this clause, to the maximum extent permitted by applicable laws, we make no other express or implied warranties for products and services, including but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and non-infringement of third-party rights. Products and services are provided to you "as is" and "as available".

1.7

No oral or written advice or information you obtain from us shall constitute any warranty not explicitly stated in this Agreement. You shall bear all risks of using this product and services.

2. Arbitration Clause

Please read the following clause carefully. It may seriously affect your legal rights, including your right to file a lawsuit in court.

2.1

We will contact you via email [ ] to answer any doubts you have about using this service or product. Most issues can be resolved through this method. You and we agree to resolve any disputes, claims, questions or differences through negotiation and good-faith negotiations, which shall be a prerequisite for either party to initiate litigation or arbitration.

2.2

If no agreement is reached within thirty (30) days from the date of informal dispute resolution in accordance with the above "Initiation of Dispute Resolution" clause, either party may initiate binding arbitration. Any disputes or claims arising from or related to this Agreement, including its validity, performance, breach, liability for damages or termination, shall be submitted to the China International Economic and Trade Arbitration Commission for arbitration in accordance with its current arbitration rules at the time of application. The place of arbitration shall be Shenzhen, China, and the arbitration language shall be Chinese.

2.3

You and we further agree that any arbitration shall be conducted in individual capacity instead of class action arbitration or other representative litigation arbitration. You and we explicitly waive the right to file class action arbitration or seek class remedies.

2.4

This Agreement and all matters related to it shall be governed and interpreted by the laws of the People's Republic of China, without regard to conflict of laws principles.

3. Contact Information

All questions, notices, requests or inquiries regarding this Agreement and Privacy Policy shall be sent to the Company:

3.1 Technical Support

support@xuanshu.local

4. Term and Termination of Agreement

4.1 Term

This Agreement shall take effect on the date you first use the service and remain valid as long as you use the service without termination by both parties.

4.2 Termination by You

You may terminate this Agreement at any time by stopping access to and use of this service.

4.3 Termination by Us

If we have reason to believe that you have violated any clause of this Agreement, we may unilaterally terminate this Agreement without prior notice. We may also terminate this Agreement upon written notice to you.

5. Indemnification

5.1 Indemnification

To the maximum extent permitted by applicable laws, you agree to indemnify and hold us harmless from any losses, costs, liabilities and expenses (including but not limited to court fees, arbitration fees, legal fees, awards or settlements) incurred by us due to your use of the service or breach of this Agreement.

6. Miscellaneous

6.1 Entire Agreement

Except as otherwise specified herein, this Agreement constitutes the entire exclusive agreement between you and us regarding your use of the service, superseding all prior or contemporaneous oral or written agreements between you and us concerning the use of this service.

6.2 Force Majeure

We shall not be liable for failure to perform obligations under this Agreement due to circumstances beyond reasonable control, including but not limited to natural disasters, wars, civil unrest, terrorist acts, embargoes, civil or military authority acts, fire, floods or accidents.

6.3 Assignment

You may not assign any rights or obligations arising under this Agreement, and any such assignment shall be null and void.

6.4 No Waiver

Failure of either party to enforce any provision of this Agreement shall not constitute a waiver of enforcement rights.

6.5 Severability

If any clause of this Agreement is deemed invalid or unenforceable, it shall be deemed valid and enforceable to the maximum extent permitted by law. If such clause cannot be modified, it shall be deemed omitted, and the remaining clauses shall remain valid and binding.`,wne={checking:"Checking for updates...",downloading:"Downloading update...",downloaded:"Download complete",backingUp:"Backing up OpenClaw data...",backupFailed:"Backup failed",installingAfterBackup:"Installing update...",currentVersion:"Current Version",updateTo:"Update To"},kne={title:zte,wechatTitle:Ute,emailTitle:Hte,description:$te,generating:qte,scanHintMp:Vte,scanHintOAuth:Gte,sdkLoading:Kte,sdkLoadFailed:Wte,retry:Qte,refresh:Yte,generateQR:Zte,qrExpired:Jte,generateFailed:Xte,loginSuccess:ene,getCode:tne,login:nne,emailTips:rne,codeTips:ane,sendCodeSuccess:sne,sendCodeFail:ine,sendCodeTips:one,readTips:lne,loggingIn:cne,switchToEmail:une,switchToWeChat:dne,emailPlaceholder:fne,codePlaceholder:hne,inviteCodePlaceholder:mne,emailInvalid:pne,cancel:gne,agreeAndContinue:yne,userDeclarationTitle:bne,userDeclarationContent:xne,userDeclarationContent_gmk:vne,ota:wne},Sne="Knowledge",Cne="Manage and collaborate on your documents",Ane={all:"All",pdf:"PDF",image:"Image",doc:"Word",ppt:"PPT",other:"Other"},Tne={myKnowledgeBase:"My Knowledge Base",allFiles:"All Files",defaultFolder:"Default Folder",localFolder:"Local Folder",localTag:"Local",searchPlaceholder:"Search documents..."},Nne={upload:"Upload File",uploadBlockedTooltip:"The knowledge engine is installing — upload is temporarily unavailable.",newFolder:"New Folder",backToParent:"Back",rename:"Rename",delete:"Delete",more:"More",edit:"Edit",newKnowledgeBase:"New Knowledge Base"},Ene={filePrompt:"Enter a new file name",folderPrompt:"Enter a new folder name"},jne={title:"Delete file",message:'Delete "{{fileName}}"? This cannot be undone.',confirm:"Delete",cancel:"Cancel"},Dne={title:"Delete folder",message:'Delete folder "{{folderName}}"? All files 